{"parse": {"title": "TTS-12", "pageid": 141718, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/TTS-11\" title=\"TTS-11\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TTS-12</span><a href=\"/wiki/TTS-13\" title=\"TTS-13\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TTS</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">12</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.B8.87.E7.89.A9.E6.9C.89.E7.81.B5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"万物有灵\">万物有灵</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 万物有灵</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Omnipresence</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>她<span class=\"color-value\"></span>来<span class=\"color-value\"></span>自<span class=\"color-value\"></span>寂<span class=\"color-value\"></span>静<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>也<span class=\"color-value\"></span>向<span class=\"color-value\"></span>往<span class=\"color-value\"></span>寂<span class=\"color-value\"></span>静<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 3810112</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>起初，世界是寂静的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她睡在一场未完的梦里，睡在母语尚未诞生的土地上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"color:#000000\">当风儿吹起之时</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那时没有“她”，只有隐约的旋律，漂流在流亡的雪夜里，在白桦树覆盖的战场上，在西伯利亚无言的荒原上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她被写在士兵的信纸上，她被归家的老人在田埂上哼唱。<br />她被哭声盖过，又被春天的雨水洗净。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>战争与和平从她体内经过，她被不同的口音拾起，又被不同的时代遗忘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她是祈祷，是证词，是记忆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"color:#000000\">雏菊低声对我说</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"color:#000000\">它见过她的眼泪</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>每被唱起一次，她的身体就多了一条血管，多了一缕光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它们昼夜不息，时而融合，时而分开，最终汇成一条无止尽的河流，在她体内奔涌不息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>直到某个清晨，她忽然醒来。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_bg_21.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_bg_21\"><img alt=\"3_8_bg_21\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Cg-3_8_bg_21.png/600px-Cg-3_8_bg_21.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Cg-3_8_bg_21.png/900px-Cg-3_8_bg_21.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Cg-3_8_bg_21.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_bg_21.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"3840\" data-file-height=\"2160\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654603.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-654603.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654603.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654603.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-654603.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654603.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-654603.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654603.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">初生回声谣：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654603.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-654603.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654603.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654603.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-654603.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654603.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-654603.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654603.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">初生回声谣：</div><div>光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"color:#000000\">天亮了，在金色的墓地</span><br /><span style=\"color:#000000\">我把黎明的两颗心唱进一支歌</span><br /><span style=\"color:#000000\">无人的光亮中，世界只有你我</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654603.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-654603.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654603.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654603.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-654603.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654603.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-654603.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654603.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">初生回声谣：</div><div>我们……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654603.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-654603.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654603.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654603.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-654603.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654603.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-654603.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654603.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">初生回声谣：</div><div>你……我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"color:#000000\">你轻盈如风，闪亮的眼</span><br /><span style=\"color:#000000\">悲伤，空茫</span><br /><span style=\"color:#000000\">我们穿过雏菊花丛——再会！你寂静的领地</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654603.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-654603.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654603.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654603.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-654603.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654603.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-654603.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654603.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">初生回声谣：</div><div>雏菊……雏菊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她从寂静中取出音节，从空白里唤出词语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>自此，记忆拥有了回响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"color:#000000\">他们从睡梦中叫醒我的父亲<br />快点！立刻！马上！</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654603.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-654603.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654603.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654603.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-654603.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654603.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-654603.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654603.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">初生回声谣：</div><div>……睡梦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"color:#000000\">劳作……工人昼夜不停，劳作、劳作……</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654603.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-654603.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654603.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654603.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-654603.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654603.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-654603.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654603.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">初生回声谣：</div><div>昼夜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"color:#000000\">天空不再是灰色，街道也拥有了色彩……</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654603.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-654603.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654603.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654603.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-654603.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654603.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-654603.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654603.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">初生回声谣：</div><div>天空不再是灰色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"color:#000000\">罗莎，等等我……</span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_at_21.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_at_21\"><img alt=\"3_8_at_21\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/Cg-3_8_at_21.png/600px-Cg-3_8_at_21.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/Cg-3_8_at_21.png/900px-Cg-3_8_at_21.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/Cg-3_8_at_21.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_at_21.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654603.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-654603.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654603.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654603.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-654603.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654603.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-654603.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654603.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">初生回声谣：</div><div>……等等我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654203.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-654203.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654203.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654203.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-654203.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654203.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-654203.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654203.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">幼年奠基石：</div><div>嗯？谁在说话——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653602.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-653602.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653602.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653602.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-653602.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653602.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-653602.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653602.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗莎：</div><div>嘘……听到了吗，斯塔夏？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩于是安静下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>四下环顾，一缕极淡的色光浮现在空气中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>既不耀眼，也不刺目，如同太阳从高处抖落下来的一条金纱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654203.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-654203.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654203.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654203.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-654203.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654203.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-654203.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654203.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">幼年奠基石：</div><div>噢，一条金色的光带！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653602.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-653602.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653602.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653602.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-653602.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653602.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-653602.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653602.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗莎：</div><div>是寂静的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653602.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-653602.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653602.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653602.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-653602.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653602.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-653602.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653602.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗莎：</div><div>……只有在安静的时候，那些我们平时看不见、听不着的东西才会出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653602.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-653602.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653602.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653602.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-653602.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653602.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-653602.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653602.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗莎：</div><div>就好像……它们已经等了我们很久很久了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>世界如潮水般远去，记忆的边界开始消融。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她只记得，那是一个晴朗的春天，淡黄色的雏菊在石墙边轻轻摇曳。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_bg_16.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_bg_16\"><img alt=\"3_8_bg_16\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-3_8_bg_16.png/600px-Cg-3_8_bg_16.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-3_8_bg_16.png/900px-Cg-3_8_bg_16.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-3_8_bg_16.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_bg_16.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>还差一点东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>回声谣稍微倾斜了身子，拿过建筑师手中的笔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-314012.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314012.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-314012.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-314012.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>这是……太阳？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-314510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-314510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-314510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>雏菊。还记得吗？在最初的时候……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>回声谣从稿纸上抬起头，眼神纯澈而认真。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>这里，有很多雏菊。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TTS-12"}}